<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates flat, 6-mth down.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates flat, 6-mth down.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was steady for the one and three-month maturities on Monday, while the six-month rate eased three points, the National Bank of Hungary said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.79 percent, the three-month rate at 20.73 percent, while the six-month rate was set at 20.56 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
